// input: emitted
// Quantities are types: an erased argument stays a parameter of type
// !idr.erased, and a linear one has type !idr.lin<T>. (A parameter is
// printed with its location, hence the {{.*}}.)
// CHECK-DAG: func.func private @Prog.clamp(%{{[^:]+}}: i64 {{.*}}, %{{[^:]+}}: i64 {{.*}}, %{{[^:]+}}: !idr.erased {{.*}}) -> i64
// CHECK-DAG: func.func private @Prog.linearId(%{{[^:]+}}: !idr.lin<i64> {{.*}}) -> i64
